# Agent workflow

Generated by `/setup`. Skills read this file after `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`.

Preset: {{PRESET}}

## Git

- branch-owner: {{BRANCH_OWNER}}   <!-- agent | human -->
- push: {{PUSH}}                   <!-- each-slice | finalize | never -->

**branch-owner: agent** — agent checkout/create branch from PRD `## Delivery`, pull --rebase before work.

**branch-owner: human** — agent stays on current branch; never checkout or create. User creates branch before `/implement`.

**push: each-slice** — push after every slice (multi-agent handoff).

**push: finalize** — push only in Finalize step.

**push: never** — skip push; user pushes and opens PR manually.

Priority: PRD `## Delivery` overrides > this file > setup preset.

## Tracker

- active: {{TRACKER_ACTIVE}}       <!-- github | local -->
- local-path: `.scratch/`

When `active: local`, see `docs/agents/issue-tracker.local.md` (if present) for file conventions.

## Work types

| Type | Pipeline | branch-owner typical |
|------|----------|----------------------|
| **feature** | `/align` → `/to-prd` → `/to-issues` → `/implement` | agent (full-agentic) or human (human-owned) |
| **complex bug** | same as feature; `/align` if root cause unclear | agent or human |
| **simple bug** | skip `/align` and `/to-issues`; single issue with AC → `/implement` | human |
| **trivial fix** | outside pipeline — direct fix + commit | n/a |

### Bug fast-path

1. Create bug issue (GitHub or `.scratch/bugs/NN-slug.md`) with acceptance criteria.
2. Set PRD/ticket status to `ready-for-implementation` without slicing.
3. `/implement #issue` — if no slice issues exist, implement AC directly from the ticket (single-slice mode).

## Session override

User may pass `/implement #N human` or `/implement #N agent` to override branch-owner for one session.
